<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com","name":"Haberler"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com\/genel","name":"Genel"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com\/mahmut-arikan-asgari-ucret-en-az-33-bin-tl-olmali","name":"Mahmut Ar\u0131kan \u2018Asgari \u00fccret en az y\u00fczde 50 art\u0131\u015fla 33 bin TL olmal\u0131\u2019"}}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"Mahmut Ar\u0131kan \u2018Asgari \u00fccret en az y\u00fczde 50 art\u0131\u015fla 33 bin TL olmal\u0131\u2019","articleSection":"Genel","dateCreated":"2025-10-23T11:59:00+03:00","datePublished":"2025-10-23T11:59:00+03:00","dateModified":"2025-10-23T11:59:00+03:00","wordCount":473,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com\/mahmut-arikan-asgari-ucret-en-az-33-bin-tl-olmali"},"articleBody":"Saadet Partisi Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mahmut Ar\u0131kan, TBMM\u2019deki haftal\u0131k grup toplant\u0131s\u0131nda yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 konu\u015fmada, 13 Ekim\u2019de ilan edilen \u015earm el \u015eeyh ate\u015fkesinin sahada kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131k bulmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yledi. Ate\u015fkesin 9 g\u00fcn i\u00e7inde 130 kez ihlal edildi\u011fini dile getiren Ar\u0131kan, \u201cKatliamlar\u0131n durmas\u0131, insani yard\u0131mlar\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131lmas\u0131 ve i\u015fgalin son bulmas\u0131 bekleniyordu.\r\n\r\nAncak sahada bunlar\u0131n hi\u00e7biri ger\u00e7ekle\u015fmedi.\u201d ifadelerini kulland\u0131. Garant\u00f6r \u00fclkelere \u201cAtt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z imzalar\u0131n gere\u011fini yerine getirin.\u201d \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131 yapan Ar\u0131kan, h\u00fck\u00fcmete de \u201c\u015earm el \u015eeyh tiyatrosunda oyuncu olmay\u0131n\u0131z.\u201d uyar\u0131s\u0131nda bulundu.\r\n\r\nKKTC ve AB Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in uyar\u0131\r\n\r\nHafta sonu yap\u0131lan KKTC Cumhurba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 se\u00e7imlerinin Ada\u2019n\u0131n sosyolojik yap\u0131s\u0131 dikkate al\u0131narak de\u011ferlendirilmesi gerekti\u011fini vurgulayan Ar\u0131kan, 1 Ocak 2026\u2019da GKRY\u2019nin AB D\u00f6nem Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131\u2019n\u0131 devralaca\u011f\u0131na dikkat \u00e7ekti. Bu s\u00fcre\u00e7te federasyon tart\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131 \u00fczerinden T\u00fcrkiye\u2019ye bask\u0131 kurulabilece\u011fini belirterek, \u201cT\u00fcrkiyesiz K\u0131br\u0131s, K\u0131br\u0131ss\u0131z T\u00fcrkiye olmaz.\u201d dedi.\r\n\r\nAdalet ve demokrasi vurgusu\r\n\r\nKonu\u015fmas\u0131nda T\u00fcrkiye\u2019de adalet sistemine y\u00f6nelik ele\u015ftirilerde bulunan Ar\u0131kan, AYM kararlar\u0131n\u0131n uygulanmamas\u0131, kayy\u0131m atamalar\u0131 ve gazetecilere y\u00f6nelik g\u00f6zalt\u0131lara de\u011findi. \u201cE\u015fitlik ve adalet duygusu zedeleniyor.\u201d diyen Ar\u0131kan, s\u00fcre\u00e7lerin tarafs\u0131z y\u00fcr\u00fct\u00fclmesi gerekti\u011fini belirtti.\r\n\r\nDiyarbak\u0131r\u2019daki y\u00fcr\u00fcy\u00fc\u015flerde g\u00fcvenlik g\u00fc\u00e7lerine y\u00f6nelik s\u00f6ylemleri de ele\u015ftiren Ar\u0131kan, \u201cS\u00fcreci \u00d6calan\u2019\u0131n \u00f6zg\u00fcrl\u00fc\u011f\u00fcne indirgemek ihanet olur.\u201d ifadelerini kulland\u0131.\r\n\r\nGemlik i\u015f\u00e7ilerine destek\r\n\r\nGrup toplant\u0131s\u0131na kat\u0131lan Gemlik Liman \u0130\u015f Sendikas\u0131 \u00fcyelerine destek veren Ar\u0131kan, \u201cHaks\u0131z \u015fekilde Kod 46 ile i\u015ften \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131lan, e-Devlet \u015fifreleri zorla a\u00e7t\u0131r\u0131larak \u00fcyelikleri sorgulanan i\u015f\u00e7iler var.\u201d diyerek sendikal haklar\u0131n korunmas\u0131 \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131nda bulundu.\r\n\r\n\u201cAsgari \u00fccret 33 bin TL olmal\u0131\u201d\r\n\r\nEkonomideki tabloya da de\u011finen Ar\u0131kan, 2026 b\u00fct\u00e7esinde vergi y\u00fck\u00fc ve garanti \u00f6demelerini sert s\u00f6zlerle ele\u015ftirdi. \u201cHer 100 liran\u0131n 21,4 liras\u0131 faize gidiyor. Hazineyi vergiyle doldurmak \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcm de\u011fildir.\u201d dedi.\r\n\r\nAsgari \u00fccret konusunda net bir \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131 yapan Ar\u0131kan, \u201cEn az y\u00fczde 50 zamla 33 bin lira olmal\u0131d\u0131r. Bunun alt\u0131 kabul edilemez.\u201d dedi. Emekli, memur, i\u015f\u00e7i ve \u00e7ift\u00e7inin b\u00fct\u00e7ede yok say\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 savunan Ar\u0131kan, \u201cFaize kaynak aktar\u0131m\u0131na de\u011fil, eme\u011fe b\u00fct\u00e7e yap\u0131lmal\u0131.\u201d mesaj\u0131n\u0131 verdi.\r\n\r\n\u201cBakanlar nereye bak\u0131yor?\u201d\r\n\r\nKonu\u015fmas\u0131n\u0131 bakanl\u0131klara y\u00f6neltti\u011fi ele\u015ftirilerle tamamlayan Ar\u0131kan, \u201cBu bakanlar nereye bak\u0131yor? Toplumun umut hakk\u0131n\u0131 b\u00fcy\u00fctecek ad\u0131mlar at\u0131lmal\u0131d\u0131r.\u201d diyerek, hem i\u00e7 politikada hem ekonomide \u201cadil, \u00fcretken ve yerli\u201d bir anlay\u0131\u015f \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131 yapt\u0131.","description":"Saadet Partisi Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mahmut Ar\u0131kan, TBMM Grup Toplant\u0131s\u0131\u2019nda d\u0131\u015f politika, ekonomi, adalet ve emek g\u00fcndemine ili\u015fkin dikkat \u00e7eken a\u00e7\u0131klamalarda\u2026","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/kayserihabercom.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/kayserihaber-com\/uploads\/2025\/10\/2025\/10\/mahmut-arikan-6.jpg","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"Mahmut Ar\u0131kan \u2018Asgari \u00fccret en az y\u00fczde 50 art\u0131\u015fla 33 bin TL olmal\u0131\u2019"},"isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com\/#organization","name":"Kayseri Haber","image":"https:\/\/kayserihabercom.teimg.com\/kayserihaber-com\/uploads\/2026\/05\/logolar\/kayseri-haber-logo2.png","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/kayserihabercom.teimg.com\/kayserihaber-com\/uploads\/2026\/05\/logolar\/kayseri-haber-logo2.png","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Nadire Nur Temur","url":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"Nadire Nur Temur","url":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com\/muhabir\/95\/nadire-nur-temur"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com\/#organization","name":"Kayseri Haber","url":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com"}}</script>


